{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54814","headline":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 十四 · 易静","name":"兵要望江南 占地第十五（二十一首） 十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"城营（京本作「营内」）地，无故动还摇。\n大战必应於岁月（京本作「内」，幷注：「城年营月也。\n」）直须移（京本作「离」）寨祸应消，不去（京本作「出」）将身招。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"易静","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}